  <section class="content-split" id="current-funds">
    <div class="content-split__image content-split__image--center">
      <img src="/assets/images/funds/wildfire-mitigation-program.webp" alt="Wildfire mitigation efforts in Teton Valley" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <div class="content-split__content" style="background: var(--color-pine);">
      <span class="content-split__eyebrow">Designated Fund</span>
      <h2 class="content-split__heading">Wildfire Mitigation Program</h2>
      <p class="content-split__text">The Wildfire Mitigation Fund was established by local citizens in response to concerns from Teton County Fire Rescue about the valley's high wildfire risk. The fund supports the expansion of the county's wildfire mitigation program, including hiring a full-time Wildfire Mitigation Specialist to coordinate mitigation efforts, model wildfire behavior, and identify high-risk areas.</p>
      <p class="content-split__text">Funds also support community education, landowner outreach, and grant-seeking to strengthen long-term wildfire and smoke preparedness across Teton County. More info: <a href="https://www.tvwildfiremitigation.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">tvwildfiremitigation.org</a></p>
      <div class="content-split__buttons">
        <a href="https://godonate.akoyago.com/cftetonvalley/fund/wildfire-mitigation-program" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="theme_btn theme_btn_bg">Give to This Fund <span aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

