      <p class="content-split__text">The A.J. Linnell Memorial Trail Fund supports the construction and maintenance of biking and hiking trails in Teton Valley that connect neighborhoods with the peaks and valleys that A.J. loved. A cyclist, educator, city councilor, mountain guide, and environmentalist, A.J. envisioned a trails system that would provide easy access to the backcountry from downtown Victor, making the quiet and beauty of the wilderness available to all.</p>
